==Special attack==
[[File:Backstab.gif|250px|thumb|A player performing the bone dagger's special attack, ''Backstab''.]]
The bone dagger has a [[special attack]], ''Backstab'', (75%) which will never miss as long as the target has not been damaged previously or you weren't the last one to damage the target. It lowers the target's [[Defence]] by the amount of damage dealt, similar to the [[Bandos godsword]]'s and [[Dorgeshuun crossbow]]'s special attacks. The defence lowering is only applied when the target doesn't currently have their defence levels lowered.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://x.com/JagexAsh/status/1798626951885889739|date=6 June 2024|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/27963410|archivedate=7 April 2026|quote=Correct - they'll only try to reduce it if it's on (or above) its base level at the time. If it had been reduced previously, then restored to the base level, they could try to reduce it again.}}

